        {
          "id": "ed06c77a-ee43-3034-a8bd-149b0391af5c",
          "content": {
            "id": "ed06c77a-ee43-3034-a8bd-149b0391af5c",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "TPG reportedly in talks to acquire Altus Power: Reuters",
            "description": "<p>TPG (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TPG\">TPG</a>) is reported in talks to acquire solar firm Altus Power (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMPS\">AMPS</a>), according to a <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/exclusive-tpg-talks-acquire-solar-193242563.html\">report from Reuters</a>, citing anonymous sources familiar with the situation. <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/?fr=sycsrp_catchall\">Josh Lipton</a> and <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/seana-smith/\">Seana Smith</a> take a closer look at the report and how the companies' stocks are reacting on Market Domination.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Domination <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">here</a>.</p>\n<p><em>This post was written by Naomi Buchanan.</em></p>",
            "summary": "TPG (TPG) is reported in talks to acquire solar firm Altus Power (AMPS), according to a report from Reuters, citing anonymous sources familiar with the situation. Josh Lipton and Seana Smith take a closer look at the report and how the companies' stocks are reacting on Market Domination. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Domination here. This post was written by Naomi Buchanan.",
